{
  "$comment": "Each lane workflow's jobs that a script finds at run time, by job id. name is the job's display name; earlier lists the other names a run from before a rename lists it under, its own id where it had no name; calls is the reusable workflow it calls, without a ref; status is the reusable's status job names, current first, for a review caller; lane is a review caller's lane id. .github/scripts/lib/lane-registry.mjs reads it, and lane-registry.test.mjs checks it against the workflows.",
